      "quote": "This review synthesizes global evidence on challenges, opportunities and strategic directions for embedding OH within health system structures.",
      "reason": "An objective/aim is stated (to synthesize evidence on challenges, opportunities and strategic directions), but the evidence does not show that objectives or questions are explicitly formulated using a relevant question-formulation framework."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Study Design: A systematic review with narrative synthesis.",
      "reason": "The review is described as a narrative synthesis, not as an intervention effects review requiring planned comparisons using PICO (and no such comparisons are described in the retrieved evidence)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 72
}

{
  "item_id": "PRISMA_2020_5",
  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Eligibility criteria were structured using the PICo framework (population, interest and context), which is appropriate for non-clinical and policy-focused research questions: Population (P) : national health systems, institutions and stakeholders involved in OH implementation. Interest (I) : challenges, opportunities, barriers, facilitators and implementation strategies related to OH integration. Context (Co) : human, animal and environmental health sectors at national or sub-national levels.",
      "reason": "The review specifies PICo-based eligibility components (population, interest, context), but does not explicitly specify eligible study characteristics such as eligible study designs, settings, and any follow-up requirements within the eligibility criteria."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "This review includes peer-reviewed studies published between 1 June 2013, and 1 April 2025... Only peer-reviewed journal articles published in English were included. Conference abstracts lacking full-text availability were excluded... Grey literature was also excluded to ensure methodological consistency and comparability across included studies.",
      "reason": "The dissemination characteristics are specified, including publication date range, language (English), and publication/report status (peer-reviewed journal articles; exclusions for conference abstracts without full text and for grey literature)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The evidence does not state a distinction between exclusions because outcomes were not measured versus because outcome results were not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The evidence provided describes narrative/thematic synthesis, but does not specify groups used in each synthesis or link them to comparisons defined in the review objectives."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Conference abstracts lacking full-text availability were excluded due to insufficient methodological detail, empirical findings or policy-relevant analysis required to extract implementation challenges, opportunities or recommendations. Grey literature was also excluded to ensure methodological consistency and comparability across included studies.",
      "reason": "Rationales are provided for notable eligibility restrictions (exclusion of conference abstracts without full text and exclusion of grey literature)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 72
}

